Aerie-Purpose: Remove crash report uploads: no upload URL, and the crash reporting mode is always disabled.
Aerie-Upstream-Area: components/crash/core/app/crash_reporter_client.cc (GetUploadUrl); chrome/browser/crash_upload_list/helium_crash_reporting.cc
Aerie-Kind: hook

Helium uploads to crash.helium.computer once the user agrees (mode Ask or
Automatic). Aerie sends no crash or telemetry data of any kind. The upload URL
is empty, so the crash handler cannot upload even if a report is requested,
and the mode getter and setter always give Disabled, which also discards any
pending reports at startup. The custom crash server switch is removed.
The settings control and the crash dialog stay; they now do nothing.

